 self.vision_tower.dtype\n-        )\n+        pixel_values: torch.Tensor = video_input[\"pixel_values_videos\"]\n         grid_thw: torch.Tensor = video_input[\"video_grid_thw\"]\n         assert grid_thw.ndim == 2\n ",
